# Every text file is checked out LF on every platform. Git for Windows defaults
# to core.autocrlf=true, which turned the checked-in plugin trees into CRLF
# bytes their recorded digests do not cover, and put a `\r` on every line of
# the bash hook scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf
packaging/codex/multi-llm/** linguist-generated=true -diff
